  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {信用|しんよう}{格付|かくづ}け: credit rating\n- {格付|かくづ}け{機関|きかん}: rating agency\n- {格付|かくづ}けを{受|う}ける: to receive a rating\n- {格付|かくづ}けを{引|ひ}き{下|さ}げる: to downgrade a rating\n\nUSAGE:\nMost commonly used in financial and business contexts for credit ratings. Also used for restaurant rankings, hotel star ratings, and other quality classifications.\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n{格|かく} (status, rank) + {付|つ}け (attaching). Literally, \"assigning a rank.\"",
